Description: Pin the C dialect to gnu17 so dhcpv6.c builds under GCC 15's C23 default
 Ubuntu resolute's GCC 15 defaults to -std=gnu23. Under C23, an empty-parens
 function declaration such as dhcpv6.c's `void (*ia_na_match)()` changes
 meaning from "unspecified parameters" (traditional/K&R C, legal through
 C17) to "takes no parameters". dhcpv6.c's iterate_over_ia_na()/
 iterate_over_ia_pd() then call/pass those pointers with real arguments,
 which the C23 reading rejects as "too many arguments" and
 incompatible-pointer-type errors. No SONiC patch touches dhcpv6.c; this is
 stock upstream isc-dhcp code that predates C23.
 .
 Tested empirically (scripts/ppa/build-clean.sh's plain ubuntu:resolute
 container, with a copy of the extracted tree so each attempt started from
 the same state): -std=gnu17 alone, with no -Wno-error= relaxations, is
 sufficient — dpkg-buildpackage -b completes cleanly and produces all
 isc-dhcp-* .deb/.ddeb artifacts. No other flag from
 sonic-slave-resolute/buildflags.conf's blanket
 "-Wno-error=incompatible-pointer-types -Wno-error=int-conversion
 -Wno-error=discarded-qualifiers" was needed for this package; only
 -std=gnu17 is carried forward here.
 .
 The sonic-slave-resolute Docker image installs buildflags.conf as
 /etc/dpkg/buildflags.conf, which applies this (and more) globally to every
 dpkg-buildpackage run in that image — but only the local self-build ever
 sees that image. A Launchpad builder, and scripts/ppa/build-clean.sh's
 vanilla ubuntu:resolute container that models it, only ever see the
 source package, so the flag has to be carried by the package itself.
Origin: vendor
Forwarded: not-needed
Author: Sheldon Qi <sheldon.qi@canonical.com>
Last-Update: 2026-07-29

--- a/debian/rules
+++ b/debian/rules
@@ -9,6 +9,15 @@
 export DEB_CFLAGS_MAINT_STRIP = -flto=auto -ffat-lto-objects
 export DEB_LDFLAGS_MAINT_STRIP = -flto=auto -ffat-lto-objects
 
+# resolute: GCC 15 默认 C23,dhcpv6.c 里 isc-dhcp 自带的 K&R 风格前置声明
+# (如 void (*ia_na_match)())在 C23 下从「参数不定」变成「零参数」,导致
+# 真实调用点报 too many arguments / incompatible-pointer-types 编译错误。
+# 把 C 方言钉回 gnu17(C17)即可,不需要放宽任何 -Wno-error。
+#
+# sonic-slave-resolute 镜像的 /etc/dpkg/buildflags.conf 全局加了这条 flag,
+# 但那只对本地自建生效;源码包本身也要带上,Launchpad builder 才看得到。
+export DEB_CFLAGS_MAINT_APPEND = -std=gnu17
+
 export DH_VERBOSE=1
 export DEB_BUILD_MAINT_OPTIONS=hardening=+all
 
